    "created_at": "2018-11-14T14:42:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-11-14T14:42:50Z",
    "body": "One use case we have, is to be able to assess how much space we're taking for caching html/js/css resources vs domain model data content. Both can be variable, so it's hard to guess how much space is left for data content for a particular user.\r\n\r\nAlso, it would help us find bugs in the browser, for example if one storage subsystem is not cleaning up resources correctly on disk eg: crbug.com/782869.",
